WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.312
Long ago, Allah chose Hud as a prophet. He said, Worship only the One Allah!

2
00:00:06.712 --> 00:00:14.560
The people of Ad were tall and strong. They built high pillars and palaces. But they grew proud and forgot Allah.

3
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:20.240
Hud said, Do not be proud! They laughed, Then let the punishment come!

4
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:26.592
Then a great drought came. The land cracked, the crops died, and the people grew afraid.

5
00:00:26.992 --> 00:00:33.904
One day, a dark cloud appeared on the horizon. The people cheered, Look! A cloud bringing rain!

6
00:00:34.304 --> 00:00:41.024
But it was no rain cloud. It was a destroying storm! The towers fell, while Hud and the believers stayed safe in the holy light.

7
00:00:41.424 --> 00:00:48.936
After the storm, new green shoots grew. Remember: never be proud. Be humble. All strength comes from Allah.
